WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.312
Raj: The runbook gap concerns fencing evidence.
手册缺口涉及隔离证据。

2
00:00:03.312 --> 00:00:07.249
Lukas: API success isn't confirmed power isolation.
API成功不等于电源隔离已确认。

3
00:00:07.249 --> 00:00:10.993
Anika: The improvement backlog needs restart inhibition.
改进清单需要包含禁止重启措施。

4
00:00:10.993 --> 00:00:15.505
Hannah: And reconciliation beyond a simple smoke test.
还需要简单快速验证以外的数据核对。

5
00:00:15.505 --> 00:00:21.578
Priya: Just to confirm, evidence required, right? For every action item.
确认一下，需要证据，对吧？每个待办项都需要。

6
00:00:21.578 --> 00:00:27.194
Raj: Yes, including host identity and independent observer confirmation.
是的，包括主机标识和独立观察员确认。

7
00:00:27.194 --> 00:00:31.563
Lukas: Maybe capture replication position before changing any role.
也许应在改变任何角色前记录复制位置。

8
00:00:31.563 --> 00:00:35.859
Anika: Our working hypothesis needs recorded loss boundaries too.
当前假设也需要记录数据损失边界。

9
00:00:35.859 --> 00:00:40.852
Hannah: Okay, preserve old logs before rebuilding replicas.
好，重建副本前先保留旧日志。

10
00:00:40.852 --> 00:00:45.460
Priya: We'll link evidence examples, not only checkbox labels.
我们会附证据示例，不只列勾选框标题。

